{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":6226057,"ns":0,"title":"Loki's wager","extract":"Loki's wager is the insistence that because two or more categories exist as poles on a spectrum  with a grey area in the middle, the distinction between the two cannot be defined.","description":"Idea that a concept is ill-defined, and therefore cannot be discussed","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}